                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Studies"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "There is so much information and misinformation about mental health online, I recommend using "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Google Scholar",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "link",
                          "attrs": {
                            "href": "https://scholar.google.com/",
                            "newTab": true
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " as your search engine to look up the latest scientific articles."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Here are a few studies I have found particularly interesting:"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The effects of meditation on perceived stress and related indices of psychological status and sympathetic activation in persons with Alzheimer's disease and their caregivers: a pilot study.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "link",
                          "attrs": {
                            "href": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/22454689",
                            "newTab": true
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "A meta-analytic review of the effects of mindfulness meditation on telomerase activity",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "link",
                          "attrs": {
                            "href": "http://www.psyneuen-journal.com/article/S0306-4530(13)00453-8/abstract",
                            "newTab": true
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Interventions for children and adolescents with posttraumatic stress disorder: A meta-analysis of comparative outcome studies",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "link",
                          "attrs": {
                            "href": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/27340855",
                            "newTab": true
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Exercise as a treatment for depression: A meta-analysis.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "link",
                          "attrs": {
                            "href": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/27253219",
                            "newTab": true
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Bright light therapy for nonseasonal depression: Meta-analysis of clinical trials",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "link",
                          "attrs": {
                            "href": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/27011361",
                            "newTab": true
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "."
                    }
